ation includes our comprehensive 115-page “Global Macro Outlook” slide deck and the resulting investment conclusions (including an updated G20 slide featuring our NEWLY RELEASED 1Q23 QUAD projections).\r\n\r\nThis investing presentation is exclusive to “Macro Pro” and Institutional subscribers.\r\n\r\nAnyone interested in upgrading will receive a pro-rated refund on their existing subscription. All you need to do is upgrade to Macro Pro here\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/esearch-yearly-1-macro-pro-556/24zcnwk/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n then email support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nmailto:support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\n to get your pro-rated refund.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGET ACCESS\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/esearch-yearly-1-macro-pro-556/24zcnwk/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/esearch-yearly-1-macro-pro-556/24zcnwk/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[LIVE WEBCAST] Rickards + McCullough 'Macro Maelstrom: An Investing Playbook For Geopolitical Chaos'\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-guest-interviews2Chedgeye-tv/24zcnwn/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWe are live &amp; in-person!\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJoin Hedgeye CEO Keith McCullough and iconoclastic global macro analyst (and bestselling author) Jim Rickards for this special investing discussion exclusively on HedgeyeTV... in our first in-person interview since the pandemic.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAs a part of Hedgeye Live, our first annual subscriber conference, we'll be hosting Jim on stage with Keith McCullough in front a live audience of Hedgeye clients and subscribers.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNot attending? No problem. We'll be broadcasting the interview LIVE &amp; FREE here at 10:30am ET on Friday, May 13th 2022\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-guest-interviews2Chedgeye-tv/24zcnwn/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n. Keith and Jim will discuss the boomerang effect of sanctions, the Federal Reserve, inflation, equities, and global macro at-large.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWant more?\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAs part of Hedgeye's 'Macrocosm Live\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/schedule/24zcnwr/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n' event with special guests, Hedgeye Live attendees will be able to watch Keith McCullough interview a world-class cohort of investors and analysts\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/speakers/24zcnwv/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n. We'll also broadcast each webcast live for Hedgeye Macro Pro\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/esearch-yearly-1-macro-pro-556/24zcnwk/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n subscribers; click here\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/esearch-yearly-1-macro-pro-556/24zcnwk/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n to learn more and upgrade your access.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMORE INFORMATION\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-guest-interviews2Chedgeye-tv/24zcnwn/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe #Quad4 Crash Is Upon Us\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-board-type-macro2Chedgeye-tv/24zcnwy/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIn this clip from The Macro Show on 5/9/22, Hedgeye CEO Keith McCullough\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/KeithMcCullough/24zcnx2/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n talks major market #crashes across currencies, equity indices, and cryptocurrencies; specifically as they relate to Hedgeye’s #Quad4 positioning.\r\n\r\n“Markets crash from #oversold levels, don’t forget, and that’s exactly what you’re seeing here.” - McCullough\r\n\r\nFrom McCullough’s Top 3 Things on Monday morning (5/9/22):\r\n\r\nAnother Deep #Quad4 in Q2 morning, it is…\r\n\r\n\tCRASHES – with a 100% batting avg, asset prices crash when the Fed tightens into a #Quad4 slowdown – only 7.93 hikes left in 2022? We’ll see. In the meantime the NASDAQ and Russell have already crashed -24.4% and -24.7% from their #Quad2 Cycle Peaks – the beloved Bitcoin’s crash now stands at -51% and we’re reiterating the SELLs on...\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWATCH HERE\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-board-type-macro2Chedgeye-tv/24zcnwy/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2021-06-15-fxmptl/24zcnx5/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nABOUT HEDGEYE\r\n\r\nHedgeye Risk Management is an independent investment research and online financial media company, focused exclusively on generating and delivering thoughtful investment ideas in a proven buy-side process.  The firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing.  \r\n\r\nThe Hedgeye team features some of the most highly-regarded research analysts on Wall Street, covering Macro, Financials, Energy, Healthcare, Retail, Gaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure (GLL), Restaurants, Industrials, Consumer Staples, Internet &amp; Media, Housing, Materials, Technology, Demography and Washington policy analysis, including Macro, Energy, Healthcare, Telecom &amp; Media and Defense.\r\n\r\nUse of Hedgeye and any other products available through hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/2022-05-11/24zcnx8/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n are subject to our Terms of Service\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-o-/24zcnxc/763685062?h=adD00G6oO5NltN_KMR-aHSN85vKuegI6_zq91Mz9TgQ\r\n\r\n and Privacy